practiceProblems.problemStatement:
Build a retryable delivery channel from scratch:

1. Interface Retryable:
   - Method: int getMaxRetries();

2. Abstract Class BaseChannel:
   - Field: protected String dest
   - Constructor: BaseChannel(String dest)
   - Abstract Method: public abstract boolean deliver(String msg);

3. Class PushChannel (extends BaseChannel implements Retryable):
   - Field: private int attempts = 0
   - Constructor: PushChannel(dest) calling super(dest)
   - Method 1: @Override public int getMaxRetries() returning 2
   - Method 2: @Override public boolean deliver(String msg):
     attempts++;
     if (attempts < getMaxRetries()) {
       System.out.println('[Push to ' + dest + '] Attempt ' + attempts + ' failed; retrying...');
       return deliver(msg);
     }
     System.out.println('[Push to ' + dest + '] Delivered: ' + msg);
     return true;

Test in Main:
PushChannel push = new PushChannel("device-tok-991");
push.deliver("New Direct Message");.

practiceProblems.solutionCode:
interface Retryable {
    int getMaxRetries();
}

abstract class BaseChannel {
    protected String dest;
    public BaseChannel(String dest) {
        this.dest = dest;
    }
    public abstract boolean deliver(String msg);
}

class PushChannel extends BaseChannel implements Retryable {
    private int simulatedFailures = 1;
    public PushChannel(String dest) {
        super(dest);
    }
    @Override
    public int getMaxRetries() {
        return 3;
    }
    @Override
    public boolean deliver(String msg) {
        for (int attempt = 1; attempt <= getMaxRetries(); attempt++) {
            if (simulatedFailures > 0) {
                System.out.println("[Push to " + dest + "] Attempt " + attempt + " failed; retrying...");
                simulatedFailures--;
            } else {
                System.out.println("[Push to " + dest + "] Delivered: " + msg);
                return true;
            }
        }
        return false;
    }
}

public class PushApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        PushChannel push = new PushChannel("device-tok-991");
        push.deliver("New Direct Message");
    }
}

