Enforce rate limits on webhook calls from scratch:

1. Interface RateLimited:
   - Method: int getLimitPerMinute();

2. Abstract Class WebhookEndpoint (implements RateLimited):
   - Field: protected String endpointUrl
   - Constructor: WebhookEndpoint(String url)
   - Abstract Method: public abstract boolean post(String payload);

3. Class SlackWebhook (extends WebhookEndpoint):
   - Field: private int currentCount = 0
   - Constructor: SlackWebhook(url) calling super(url)
   - Method 1: @Override public int getLimitPerMinute() returning 2
   - Method 2: @Override public boolean post(String payload):
     if (currentCount < getLimitPerMinute()) {
       currentCount++;
       System.out.println('[Slack POST to ' + endpointUrl + '] ' + payload);
       return true;
     }
     System.out.println('[Slack] Rejected: Rate limit exceeded (' + getLimitPerMinute() + '/min)');
     return false;

Test in Main:
SlackWebhook slack = new SlackWebhook("https://slack.com/hook");
slack.post("Msg 1"); slack.post("Msg 2"); slack.post("Msg 3");.

practiceProblems.solutionCode:
interface RateLimited {
    int getLimitPerMinute();
}

abstract class WebhookEndpoint implements RateLimited {
    protected String endpointUrl;
    public WebhookEndpoint(String endpointUrl) {
        this.endpointUrl = endpointUrl;
    }
    public abstract void post(String payload);
}

class SlackWebhook extends WebhookEndpoint {
    private int postCount = 0;
    public SlackWebhook(String url) {
        super(url);
    }
    @Override
    public int getLimitPerMinute() {
        return 2;
    }
    @Override
    public void post(String payload) {
        postCount++;
        if (postCount > getLimitPerMinute()) {
            System.out.println("[Slack] Rejected: Rate limit exceeded (" + getLimitPerMinute() + "/min)");
        } else {
            System.out.println("[Slack POST to " + endpointUrl + "] " + payload);
        }
    }
}

public class SlackApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        WebhookEndpoint slack = new SlackWebhook("https://slack.com/hook");
        slack.post("Msg 1");
        slack.post("Msg 2");
        slack.post("Msg 3");
    }
}

